<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia raises 6.89 mln dinars in bond issue.</title>
<headline>Tunisia raises 6.89 mln dinars in bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday said it has raised 6.89 million dinars from this month's issue of treasury bonds negotiable at the bourse (BTNB).</p>
<p>It said it has sold 10-year bonds worth 1.59 dinars at 10.5 percent and five-year paper worth 5.3 million dinars at 9.5 percent.  ($=0.96 dinar)</p>
